{"answer":"Your browser or operating system starts with the website name and checks its local DNS cache. If it finds a matching answer that is still valid, it returns the stored IP address immediately. Otherwise, your device sends the name to a recursive DNS resolver, which searches on its behalf and first may check its own cache.

If the resolver has no usable cached answer, it follows referrals through DNS: a root server points it to the relevant top-level-domain server, which points it to the authoritative DNS server for the website’s domain. The authoritative server supplies the address record, or a name alias that must also be resolved. The resolver returns the resulting IP address to your device.

Your browser then uses that IP address to contact the website’s server; DNS itself does not download the webpage. The device and resolver can cache the answer for its specified time-to-live, allowing later lookups to finish faster while the cached record remains valid.","coverage":[{"id":"m1","quotes":["Your browser or operating system starts with the website name and checks its local DNS cache.","If it finds a matching answer that is still valid, it returns the stored IP address immediately."]},{"id":"m2","quotes":["Otherwise, your device sends the name to a recursive DNS resolver, which searches on its behalf and first may check its own cache."]},{"id":"m3","quotes":["If the resolver has no usable cached answer, it follows referrals through DNS: a root server points it to the relevant top-level-domain server, which points it to the authoritative DNS server for the website’s domain."]},{"id":"m4","quotes":["The authoritative server supplies the address record, or a name alias that must also be resolved.","The resolver returns the resulting IP address to your device."]},{"id":"m5","quotes":["Your browser then uses that IP address to contact the website’s server; DNS itself does not download the webpage.","The device and resolver can cache the answer for its specified time-to-live, allowing later lookups to finish faster while the cached record remains valid."]}]}
